OL,3,GNEWSAWarnings of more airport
OL,4,Adisruption as air traffic control
OL,5,Arecovery taking 'longer than hoped'
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of flights have been cancelled
OL,8,Fat airports across the UK due to an
OL,9,Fissue with air traffic control
OL,11,FNats - the air traffic control provider
OL,12,F- says the glitch is with its "flight
OL,13,Fprocessing system" and that a fix has
OL,14,Fbeen deployed, later adding recovery
OL,15,Fwas "taking longer than hoped"
OL,17,FHeathrow, Manchester and East Midlands
OL,18,Fairports are among those that reported
OL,19,F- airports in Scotland and Ireland have
OL,20,Falso experienced delays
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
