OL,3,GNEWSAWarnings of more airport
OL,4,Adisruption as air traffic control
OL,5,Arecovery taking 'longer than hoped'
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome airports say they are expecting a
OL,8,Ffull schedule of flights to run on
OL,9,FWednesday, but warn of airports being
OL,10,Fbusier due to rescheduled flights
OL,12,FRyanair says 65,000 of its passengers
OL,13,Fhave been delayed by up to eight hours
OL,14,Fwhile British Airways warns of a
OL,15,F"significant knock-on impact for
OL,16,Fcustomers and colleagues"
